    "text": "By From staff reports ,\n13 hours ago As of 11:10 p.m. Tuesday, March 3, the Burnet County Elections Office released the unofficial cumulative results of the Republican primary election. The Republican race results for the county judge seat showed incumbent Burnet County Judge Bryan Wilson received 52.30% (4,625 votes) to 47.70% (4,218 votes) for Alan Trevino. In... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
